<title>INDIA: India expects $6.7 bln assistance at Paris meeting.</title>
<headline>India expects $6.7 bln assistance at Paris meeting.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>India expects to get a $6.7 billion external assistance at the India Development Forum meeting scheduled to be held in Paris next week, a Finance Ministry official said on Saturday</p>
<p>&quot;We expect $6.7 billion, same as last year,&quot; the Finance Ministry official, who asked not to be identified, told Reuters.</p>
</text>
